  onStyleOrganicHint: ["Earthy paper colours, soft round shapes and serif headings", "흙빛 종이색, 부드럽고 둥근 모양, 세리프 제목", "大地色纸张、柔和圆润的形状、衬线标题", "土の色の紙、やわらかな丸い形、セリフ体の見出し", "Colores de papel terrosos, formas suaves y redondeadas y títulos con serifa", "Teintes papier terreuses, formes douces et arrondies, titres à empattements"],
